ke, Echo Point and Photo Point.","id":"south-india-highlight-day-3","location":"","activities":[],"meals":"","accommodation":"","images":[],"notes":"","visible":true,"stops":[],"transfers":""},{"day":4,"title":"Munnar – Thekkady","description":"Visit Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary, Elephant Junction and Kalaripayattu Show.","id":"south-india-highlight-day-4","location":"","activities":[],"meals":"","accommodation":"","images":[],"notes":"","visible":true,"stops":[],"transfers":""},{"day":5,"title":"Thekkady – Alleppey","description":"After breakfast, proceed to Alleppey and board the houseboat by 12:00 noon. Enjoy cruising through the backwaters. Lunch at 13:30 hrs, cruise resumes at 14:30 hrs, with tea and snacks onboard. Houseboat reaches the halt by 18:00 hrs. Overnight stay on the houseboat.","id":"south-india-highlight-day-5","location":"","activities":[],"meals":"","accommodation":"","images":[],"notes":"","visible":true,"stops":[],"transfers":""},{"day":6,"title":"Alleppey","description":"Alleppey Beach, Marari Beach, Alleppey Lighthouse and Alleppey Market.","id":"south-india-highlight-day-6","location":"","activities":[],"meals":"","accommodation":"","images":[],"notes":"","visible":true,"stops":[],"transfers":""},{"day":7,"title":"Alleppey – Varkala","description":"Visit Jatayu Earth Centre and Munroe Island.","id":"south-india-highlight-day-7","location":"","activities":[],"meals":"","accommodation":"","images":[],"notes":"","visible":true,"stops":[],"transfers":""},{"day":8,"title":"Varkala","description":"Local sightseeing: Varkala Beach, Kappil Beach, Varkala Cliff and Sree Janardhan Swamy Temple.","id":"south-india-highlight-day-8","location":"","activities":[],"meals":"","accommodation":"","images":[],"notes":"","visible":true,"stops":[],"transfers":""},{"day":9,"title":"Varkala – Kovalam","description":"Visit Hawah Beach, Samudra Beach, Kovalam Beach and Vizhinjam Lighthouse.","id":"south-india-highlight-day-9","location":"","activities":[],"meals":"","