r generations."}],"text":"Explore India and Nepal with a specialist since 1927—from Himalayan peaks to tranquil backwaters."},{"key":"wildlife","label":"Wildlife","title":"Wildlife Experiences","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/13409974/pexels-photo-13409974.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Rare Habitat Encounters Guided by Resident Naturalists","statBadge":"Protected Reserves","statLabel":"Resident Trackers","regionTag":"Chitwan, Periyar & Terai","body":"Wildlife journeys reach Chitwan, Periyar and the Terai, with resident naturalists, elephant and jeep safaris, nature walks and canoe trips among the programme options.","href":"/journeys?activity=wildlife#catalogue","linkLabel":"Explore wildlife journeys","highlights":[{"title":"Diverse Safari Formats","detail":"Jeep safaris, jungle nature walks, and tranquil river canoe expeditions across reserves."},{"title":"Low-Impact Field Ethos","detail":"Respectful, ethical observation in premier national parks and protected habitats."}],"text":"Wildlife journeys reach Chitwan, Periyar and the Terai, with resident naturalists, elephant and jeep safaris, nature walks and canoe trips among the programme options."},{"key":"guides","label":"Guides","title":"Guides & Dedicated Support","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/18563694/pexels-photo-18563694.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Experienced Field Crews & Dedicated Expedition Leaders","statBadge":"Escorted","statLabel":"Mountain Field Crews","regionTag":"Himalayas & High Passes","body":"Trekking itineraries in our catalogue are escorted by experienced English-speaking guides and support crews. Special-interest tours are led by a team leader from Australia who specialises in a particular area.","href":"/journeys","linkLabel":"See trekking journeys","highlights":[{"title":"English-Speaking Guides","detail":"Seasoned mountain leaders fluent in regional trails, local dialects, and high-altitude safety."},{"title":"Dedicated Support Crews","detail":"Full camp staff, porter crews, and kitchen teams accompanying every trekking stage."},{"title":"Specialist Tour Leaders","detail":"Specialist itineraries accompanied by experienced leaders dedicated to the field."}],"text":"Trekking itineraries in our catalogue are escorted by experienced English-speaking guides and support crews. Special-interest tours are led by a team leader from Australia who specialises in a particular area."},{"key":"architecture","label":"Accommodation","title":"Character & Heritage Accommodation","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/17397822/pexels-photo-17397822.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Heritage Stays and Local Character","statBadge":"Heritage","statLabel":"Historic Character","regionTag":"Centrally Located Stays","body":"All accommodation is carefully selected: well serviced and centrally located, chosen for ambience, comfort, architecture and history, from deluxe categories to family-run establishments.","href":"/journeys?category=India%20Tours#catalogue","linkLabel":"See India tours","highlights":[{"title":"Historic Character & Ambience","detail":"Properties chosen for distinct architecture, history, and authentic sense of place."},{"title":"Centrally Located Stays","detail":"Well-serviced hotels located near key sights to eliminate unnecessary transit delays."},{"title":"Family-Run Hospitality","detail":"Warmth, character, and attentive service across vetted boutique and deluxe categories."}],"text":"All accommodation is carefully selected: well serviced and centrally located, chosen for ambience, comfort, architecture and history, from deluxe categories to family-run establishments."},{"key":"culture","label":"Culture","title":"Living Cultural Exploration","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/36754808/pexels-photo-36754808.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Living Sacred Ceremonies, Monasteries & Ancient Ways","statBadge":"Authentic Access","statLabel":"Living Traditions","regionTag":"Varanasi to Ladakh","body":"From dawn on the ghats of Varanasi to Buddhist monasteries in Ladakh, each place honours its own traditions. Special-interest programmes can be arranged for clubs, schools and groups on request.","href":"/journeys?activity=culture#catalogue","linkLabel":"Explore cultural journeys","highlights":[{"title":"Sacred Rituals & Monasteries","detail":"Dawn ceremonies on the Ganges ghats, serene Ladakh gompas, and floating Dal Lake markets."},{"title":"Living Traditions","detail":"Insightful cultural exchanges honouring regional customs and local communities."},{"title":"Special-Interest Programmes","detail":"Tailored arrangements for photography societies, study groups, and special clubs."}],"text":"From dawn on the ghats of Varanasi to Buddhist monasteries in Ladakh, each place honours its own traditions. Special-interest programmes can be arranged for clubs, schools and groups on request."},{"key":"travel","label":"Travel","title":"Seamless, Trusted Travel","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/5774277/pexels-photo-5774277.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Private Road Transfers & Complete Peace of Mind","statBadge":"Seamless","statLabel":"Private Road Transit","regionTag":"Door-to-Door Pacing","body":"Road transfers, accommodation and sightseeing are planned around your dates and party.","href":"/enquiry","linkLabel":"Talk to a travel designer","highlights":[{"title":"Individual Tailor-Made Pacing","detail":"Flexible itineraries adapted to your specific dates, travel party, and desired rhythm."}],"text":"Road transfers, accommodation and sightseeing are planned around your dates and party."},{"key":"impact","label":"Impact","title":"Programmes & Heritage Stewardship","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/33885308/pexels-photo-33885308.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","taglin