to tranquil backwaters."},{"key":"wildlife","label":"Wildlife","title":"Wildlife Experiences","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/13409974/pexels-photo-13409974.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Rare Habitat Encounters Guided by Resident Naturalists","statBadge":"Protected Reserves","statLabel":"Resident Trackers","regionTag":"Chitwan, Periyar & Terai","body":"Wildlife journeys reach Chitwan, Periyar and the Terai, with resident naturalists, elephant and jeep safaris, nature walks and canoe trips among the programme options.","href":"/journeys?activity=wildlife#catalogue","linkLabel":"Explore wildlife journeys","highlights":[{"title":"Diverse Safari Formats","detail":"Jeep safaris, jungle nature walks, and tranquil river canoe expeditions across reserves."},{"title":"Low-Impact Field Ethos","detail":"Respectful, ethical observation in premier national parks and protected habitats."}],"text":"Wildlife journeys reach Chitwan, Periyar and the Terai, with resident naturalists, elephant and jeep safaris, nature walks and canoe trips among the programme options."},{"key":"guides","label":"Guides","title":"Guides & Dedicated Support","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/18563694/pexels-photo-18563694.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Experienced Field Crews & Dedicated Expedition Leaders","statBadge":"Escorted","statLabel":"Mountain Field Crews","regionTag":"Himalayas & High Passes","body":"Trekking itineraries in our catalogue are escorted by experienced English-speaking guides and support crews. Special-interest tours are led by a team leader from Australia who specialises in a particular area.","href":"/journeys","linkLabel":"See trekking journeys","highlights":[{"title":"English-Speaking Guides","detail":"Seasoned mountain leaders fluent in regional trails, local dialects, and high-altitude safety."},{"title":"Dedicated Support Crews","detail":"Full camp staff, porter crews, and kitchen teams accompanying every trekking stage."},{"title":"Specialist Tour Leaders","detail":"Specialist itineraries accompanied by experienced leaders dedicated to the field."}],"text":"Trekking itineraries in our catalogue are escorted by experienced English-speaking guides and support crews. Special-interest tours are led by a team leader from Australia who specialises in a particular area."},{"key":"architecture","label":"Accommodation","title":"Character & Heritage Accommodation","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/17397822/pexels-photo-17397822.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Heritage Stays and Local Character","statBadge":"Heritage","statLabel":"Historic Character","regionTag":"Centrally Located Stays","body":"All accommodation is carefully selected: well serviced and centrally located, chosen for ambience, comfort, architecture and history, from deluxe categories to family-run establishments.","href":"/journeys?category=India%20Tours#catalogue","linkLabel":"See India tours","highlights":[{"title":"Historic Character & Ambience","detail":"Properties chosen for distinct architecture, history, and authentic sense of place."},{"title":"Centrally Located Stays","detail":"Well-serviced hotels located near key sights to eliminate unnecessary transit delays."},{"title":"Family-Run Hospitality","detail":"Warmth, character, and attentive service across vetted boutique and deluxe categories."}],"text":"All accommodation is carefully selected: well serviced and centrally located, chosen for ambience, comfort, architecture and history, from deluxe categories to family-run establishments."},{"key":"culture","label":"Culture","title":"Living Cultural Exploration","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/36754808/pexels-photo-36754808.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Living Sacred Ceremonies, Monasteries & Ancient Ways","statBadge":"Authentic Access","statLabel":"Living Traditions","regionTag":"Varanasi to Ladakh","body":"From dawn on the ghats of Varanasi to Buddhist monasteries in Ladakh, each place honours its own traditions. Special-interest programmes can be arranged for clubs, schools and groups on request.","href":"/journeys?activity=culture#catalogue","linkLabel":"Explore cultural journeys","highlights":[{"title":"Sacred Rituals & Monasteries","detail":"Dawn ceremonies on the Ganges ghats, serene Ladakh gompas, and floating Dal Lake markets."},{"title":"Living Traditions","detail":"Insightful cultural exchanges honouring regional customs and local communities."},{"title":"Special-Interest Programmes","detail":"Tailored arrangements for photography societies, study groups, and special clubs."}],"text":"From dawn on the ghats of Varanasi to Buddhist monasteries in Ladakh, each place honours its own traditions. Special-interest programmes can be arranged for clubs, schools and groups on request."},{"key":"travel","label":"Travel","title":"Seamless, Trusted Travel","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/5774277/pexels-photo-5774277.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Private Road Transfers & Complete Peace of Mind","statBadge":"Seamless","statLabel":"Private Road Transit","regionTag":"Door-to-Door Pacing","body":"Road transfers, accommodation and sightseeing are planned around your dates and party.","href":"/enquiry","linkLabel":"Talk to a travel designer","highlights":[{"title":"Individual Tailor-Made Pacing","detail":"Flexible itineraries adapted to your specific dates, travel party, and desired rhythm."}],"text":"Road transfers, accommodation and sightseeing are planned around your dates and party."},{"key":"impact","label":"Impact","title":"Programmes & Heritage Stewardship","image":"https://images.pexels.com/photos/33885308/pexels-photo-33885308.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&h=800&fit=crop&dpr=2","tagline":"Pioneering Educational Expeditions & Local Community Ties","statBadge":"Community First","statLabel":"Shared Stewardship","regionTag":"Subcontinent Wide","body":"Escorted student tours run for schools in both India and Nepal, and special-interest programmes can be arranged for clubs, schools and groups.","href":"/about","linkLabel":"Read about our heritage","highlights":[{"title":"Escorted Student Expeditions","detail":"Curated educational journeys fostering global empathy and outdoor experiential learning."},{"title":"Direct Community Investment","detail":"Direct engagement supporting regional guides, boatmen, local artisans, and family lodges."},{"title":"Centuries of Local Kinship","detail":"Rooted in four generations of family hospitality and regional stewardship since 1927."}],"text":"Escorted student tours run for schools in both India and Nepal, and special-interest programmes can be arranged for clubs, schools and groups."}]},{"id":"impact","type":"image-text","visible":true,"variant":"impact","eyebrow":"Curated regional programmes","heading":"Travel deeper. Learn along the way.","subheading":"Special-interest and student expeditions across India and Nepal.","description":"All special-interest programmes are escorted by qualified team leaders. Every itinerary is drawn directly from our brochure archives and shaped with meticulous care around your travel season, party size and regional interests.","image":"","images":[],"ctaPrimary":{"label":"Discover our approach","href":"/about","visible":true}},{"id":"cta","type":"cta","visible":true,"eyebrow":"Plan your journey","heading":"India & Nepal, your way.","description":"Tell us what you want to discover. We’ll help shape the journey.","image":"/images/orbit/kashmir-shikara-peaks.jpg","imageAlt":"A shikara on Dal Lake beneath the forested and snow-capped Kashmir mountains","ctaPrimary":{"label":"Enquire now","href":"/enquiry","visible":true}}],"seo":{}}'::jsonb, 'home', 0, now())
